	<ouc:div label="main-content" group="Everyone" button-text="Main Content"><ouc:editor csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt" wysiwyg-class="main-content"/><p><img style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" src="{{f:28978838}}" alt="Business, Hospitality &amp; Leadershp icon" width="324" height="321" /></p>
<p>Learn customer relations and partnership building at Lake Tahoe Community College while developing your business management knowledge. Master the expertise needed to grow your own business, or the high-demand skills employers need. Career paths include accounting, event planning, hotel or restaurant management, culinary arts, or wilderness and outdoor education.</p>
